WEBVTT

26:02.135 --> 26:04.762
The sooner we move, the better.

26:04.846 --> 26:06.639
Yeah!

26:12.812 --> 26:14.688
To infinity and beyond!

26:16.566 --> 26:18.025
All this packing
makes me hungry.

26:18.109 --> 26:21.028
What would you say to dinner
at, oh, Pizza Planet?

26:21.112 --> 26:24.031
Pizza Planet? Oh, cool!

26:24.824 --> 26:26.867
Go wash your hands,
and I'll get Molly ready.

26:26.952 --> 26:30.246
-Can I bring some toys?
-You can bring one toy.
